{'symbol': 'NXPI', 'date': '2021-06-07 15:00:00', 'title': "NXP'S DEVELOPMENT TOOLS ENABLE NEW ULTRA-WIDEBAND APPLICATIONS FOR IPHONE AND APPLE WATCH", 'text': 'EINDHOVEN, THE NETHERLANDS, JUNE 07, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- NXP SEMICONDUCTORS N.V. (NASDAQ: NXPI) HAS\xa0ANNOUNCED THAT IT NOW OFFERS BETA ULTRA-WIDEBAND (UWB) DEVELOPMENT TOOLS FROM ITS NXP TRIMENSION™\xa0PORTFOLIO THAT INTEROPERATE WITH THE U1 CHIP IN SUPPORTED APPLE PRODUCTS. THE\xa0BETA DEVELOPMENT\xa0TOOLS WILL ALLOW DEVELOPERS TO\xa0KICK-START THE\xa0DESIGN OF INNOVATIVE APPLICATIONS THAT INTERACT WITH\xa0UWB ENABLED APPLE PRODUCTS INCLUDING IPHONE AND APPLE WATCH*,\xa0UNLEASHING THE ABILITY TO CREATE MORE\xa0PRECISE, DIRECTIONALLY AWARE APP EXPERIENCES.'}